  "description": "bit Bmage for Blazor: browser-side image processing on the user's device from strongly typed C#, on top of the Bit.Bmage engine. Browser-native WebP and AVIF codecs, capability detection, IBrowserFile/clipboard/camera input, loading and export and dependency injection wiring, with codec work in Web Workers. Works in WebAssembly, Server, Auto and Hybrid render modes. Includes BmageEditor, a themeable, accessible, touch-friendly image editor component: crop, rotate, adjust, filter, draw, annotate, redact, undo/redo and export.",
